The classic spigot algorithm (Gibbons) uses big integers. PHP has GMP extension. Let's use GMP.

The Gibbons algorithm:

```
q, r, t, k, n, l = 1, 0, 1, 1, 3, 3
while True:
    if 4*q + r - t < n*t:
        yield n
        q, r, t, k, n, l = (
            10*q,
            10*(r - n*t),
